<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts Pricer.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts Pricer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish price labelling group Pricer AB was rated &quot;buy&quot; at Lehman Brothers as the investment bank started coverage of the stock, Lehman said on Monday.</p>
<p>Lehman set a price target of 340 Swedish crowns on the stock and said its recent partnership with Telxon and acquisiton of Intactix had positioned Pricer to move aggressively into retail automation.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
